  "explanation": {
    "md_es": [
      "**Vocabulario de medio ambiente**",
      "",
      "| Ámbito | Palabras clave |",
      "|---|---|",
      "| Problemas | *climate change, global warming, pollution, deforestation, overfishing, biodiversity loss, extinction* |",
      "| Causas | *fossil fuels, greenhouse gases, emissions, intensive farming, overconsumption, waste* |",
      "| Efectos | *drought, flood, wildfire, heatwave, sea-level rise, melting ice, habitat loss* |",
      "| Soluciones | *renewable energy, solar, wind, recycling, carbon offsetting, reforestation, sustainable transport* |",
      "| Conceptos | *carbon footprint, sustainability, circular economy, net zero, eco-friendly, biodegradable* |",
      "",
      "**Colocaciones**",
      "",
      "- *tackle climate change · reduce / cut emissions · switch to renewable energy · protect the environment · endanger species · raise awareness · take action · lower your carbon footprint · recycle waste · go green · live sustainably*.",
      "- *endangered species · natural resources · renewable / non-renewable · wildlife · ecosystem · conservation*.",
      "",
      "**Environment, nature, ecology**",
      "",
      "- *The environment* = entorno natural, problema ambiental. · *Nature* = lo natural, vida silvestre. · *Ecology* = ciencia de los ecosistemas. ✘ *ecologic* → ✔ *ecological / eco-friendly*.",
      "",
      "**Quantifiers en temas ambientales**",
      "",
      "- *a large amount of waste (incontable) · a large number of species (contable) · much pollution · many forests · little water · few trees · plenty of sunshine*.",
      "",
      "**Errores típicos**",
      "",
      "- ✘ *The pollutions are a problem.* → ✔ *Pollution is a problem.* (incontable).",
      "- ✘ *The global warming is increasing.* → ✔ *Global warming is increasing.* (sin the).",
      "- ✘ *We must protect the nature.* → ✔ *We must protect nature.*",
      "- ✘ *Ecologic products* → ✔ *Eco-friendly products.*",
      "- ✘ *A lot of waste are thrown away.* → ✔ *A lot of waste is thrown away.*",
      "",
      "**Ojo:** *rubbish / waste / litter / garbage / trash*: *rubbish* (UK, general), *garbage / trash* (US), *waste* (residuos industriales o domésticos), *litter* (basura en la calle). *Environmentalist* (ecologista) ≠ *environmental* (adj.).",
      "",
      "Pronunciación: *deforestation* /diːˌfɒrɪˈsteɪʃn/ · *biodegradable* /ˌbaɪəʊdɪˈɡreɪdəbl/ · *emissions* /ɪˈmɪʃnz/ · *ecosystem* /ˈiːkəʊsɪstəm/."
    ],
